/-!
# Degree-36 rank-one and presentation certificates

The five literal ATLAS relators, rank-one polynomial, orbit bases and
their inverses are proved on the same two matrix generators.

Generated by `ThirtySix/generate.py` from the preserved ATLAS J2G1-f2r36B0
matrices and rank-one record. The numerical answers are witnesses only;
each arithmetic claim is checked by Lean's kernel.
-/

